{"data":{"body":"[P2] Include every required behavior budget in this example. `load_manifest` rejects this two-field object: `deadline-during-step` also requires `observationGraceMs`, while `peer-recovery` requires both `observationGraceMs` and `recoveryMs`. Following the documented configuration therefore fails before execution or evidence reporting. Show complete budget objects matching each requirement's `behaviorBudgets`, and retain those complete objects in the evidence.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABEcZudg","finding_digest":"704165e6df336ef4e58ee1b96cfe24fd817ec30e87646bb15547bc741e7a4181","finding_id":"arf_v1_obawlzw7gnxpjzmo4g4wz7re7w","finding_key":"lmi/readme.md::behavior-budgets-example::complete-required-budget-fields","identity_key":"lmi/readme.md::behavior-budgets-example::complete-required-budget-fields","line":127,"observation_digest":"d76a68590c761cdf729cdeff8c405fa7fac359e6fc0af1b663e5a26a1bdaa555","observation_id":"aro_v1_25vgqwimoyon64u4337yyqc7u7","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests/lmi/README.md","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_obawlzw7gnxpjzmo4g4wz7re7w","published_at":"2026-11-16T23:34:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vrqlysqrhwhzoevgiswz4qbiqw","reviewed_base_sha":"cdf6fa1ddd0871f299386c172bf911757f490b18","reviewed_head_sha":"a808cbb1d1121619ba0c4dea7e301ccda558416d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":126,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":190},"record_id":"art_v1_qp5wlq3x4otfycxhxabem66yki","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-16T23:34:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
